		name.id_no = id_no
		name.age = age
teac = Teacher(5, 25)
</textarea></div><p><strong>Which of the following statements is incorrect regarding this program?</strong></p><ol class="pointsa"><li>A constructor has been given in this program</li><li>id_no and age are called the parameters</li><li>The "teac" is the reference variable for the object Teacher(5, 25)</li><li>None of the these</li></ol><button class="showanswer" onclick="showhide(40)"><span id="btntext40">Show Answer</span></button> <button class="workspace" onclick="showworkspace(40)"><span id="btntext40">Workspace</span></button><div id="workspace40"></div><div class="testanswer" id="answer40"><p><strong>Answer:</strong> (d) None of the these</p><p><strong>Explanation:</strong> All statements are correct. So, the option (d) is the correct answer.</p></div><hr/><p class="pq">41) Study the following program:</p><div class="codeblock"><textarea class="java" name="code">class Teacher:
